WEBVTT

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.080
Who are you?

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.520
Why do you want the black camellia?

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.970
If I don't get the black camellia,

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.360
I won't be given eternity.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:41.470
Eternity?

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.230
The black camellia is a magical sword.

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:48.690
The king's sword, which grants 
eternity to anyone stabbed by it.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:51.600
Magical? What're you talking about?

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:57.000
I don't care if you don't believe me.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.490
If you don't understand, 
someday I'll show you...

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.840
The king's power, which 
exceeds human knowledge.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:14.010
I don't get it, but are you sure about this?

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:18.390
Is it wise to have Tsugumi 
retrieve your prized possession?

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:21.010
You do realize how useless she is?

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:23.430
True.

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:37.570
It's unwise to keep relying on others.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.590
Be careful, Tsugumi-san!

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.450
Hayate-kun!

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:10.560
Hayate Ayasaki!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.530
Hah, serves you right!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.650
Let's get away with the money!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.480
Hayata-kun!

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.520
Hayate-kun, hang in there!

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.530
I'm alive?

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:30.960
Thank goodness!

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:33.840
It looked like you'd been
 stabbed, so I thought...

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.790
It seems you weren't hurt.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.430
Um, are you really okay?

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:44.350
Yes,

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:47.730
I'm fine.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.770
What's that?

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.190
What's this?

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.060
The black camellia...

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:17.580
Hand over the black camellia!

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:18.990
What?

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.340
The black camellia?

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.800
The black camellia.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.870
Die, you monster!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:26.620
Go to hell!

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.940
Are you okay, Izumi?

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:38.400
Yes...

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:43.080
Let's get out of here!

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:45.590
Okay.

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:46.900
Let's hurry, Hayate-kun!

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.240
I'll be okay. You guys go ahead.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.500
So you're Hayate Ayasaki.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.660
You have the black camellia, yes?

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.760
Hand it over!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.720
Hand over the black camellia!

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.900
Then I'll return your 
precious princess.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.090
Hayate!

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:27.530
Actually, I need to talk 
to you about something.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:32.830
"Actually"? What do you mean, "actually"?

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:36.970
How can you belittle me like 
that in a situation like this?!

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.660
Hey! Are you listening to me, Hayate?

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.710
Shut up!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:43.210
I'll listen to your stupid story after 
you give me the black camellia!

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.510
Mother!

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:51.500
Nagi...

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:53.500
 Fire Amulet: Bad Ghosts

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.710
Let go of Nagi!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:06.480
Wh-What?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.000
Hey! Let's get out of here!

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:31.550
M-My money! Give me back my money!

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.540
Why you...!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:38.520
Don't hurt my mother!

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:43.520
Dolly!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.520
We've been gone from our 
sanctuary for too long.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:49.490
The black camellia. The black...

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.860
It's too late. Your body won't last.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:55.450
We must return to the sanctuary.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:59.450
The black... camellia...

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.770
The black camellia. My...

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:07.210
Dolly.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:09.710
Dolly?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.570
I'm sorry, but we must...

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.690
The black camellia...

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:24.850
You won't escape.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.920
Stop!

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.740
Get out of here, Tsugumi!

00:08:58.110 --> 00:08:59.470
Hayate.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:03.820
Are you...

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:09.780
...upset about before?

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:11.820
When I, um...

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.570
When I was all angry?

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:24.060
About that... I apologize. 
S-So don't be like that.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:33.880
H-Hey! Wait!

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:37.090
Where are you going? 
We're not done talking!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.720
Isn't it my own business where I go?

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:44.070
Your own business? You're my butler!

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:46.150
Your...

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:49.480
...butler?

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.910
Why are you acting like this?

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:59.880
You promised to protect me from
 danger. That's a butler's job!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.450
Then...

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:06.120
I quit being your butler.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.500
Goodbye, Miss Nagi.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:18.580
Hayate.

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:46.580
Um... Nagi-chan?

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:18.570
I'm totally...

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:19.950
...fine!

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:24.200
I'm totally fine without Hayate!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.280
Totally!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:29.270
I'm totally fine!

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.420
Such a brave front.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.670
A brave front.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.670
A brave front.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:42.680
Well, we're here in Las Vegas!

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:45.930
Let's go sightseeing. Sightseeing!

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:05.700
What're you guys doing here?

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.180
Oh, Teacher.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:08.830
Why are you here?

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.330
I'm here because Yukiji invited me.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:15.020
My big sister did? 
And what's up with this car?

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:17.710
It's really something, 
but why do you have it?

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:21.820
Oh, this? Well, see, Yukiji...

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:25.390
<i>Yes! I got a boatload of money.</i>

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:29.180
<i>I'll pay you back later, 
so use your savings and</i>

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.990
<i>buy me the best car out there!</i>

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:34.450
So I bought it!

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:39.270
Do you know where Yukiji is?

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:41.180
She hasn't answered her 
phone since yesterday.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.250
Teacher! What an amazing car!

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.740
Yeah? You think so?

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:50.850
Wanna go for a ride?

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.620
Say, to Area 51?

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.900
Wow, really?

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.440
Um, Nagi.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:01.220
I'll go look for my big sister,

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.510
so you look for Hayate-kun, Maria-san.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:07.040
It doesn't look like she'll be
 doing any serious searching, so...

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:07.210
<i>Will you really take me to Area 51, Teacher?</i>

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:07.640
<i>Sure.</i>

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.770
<i>It's a really special place.</i>

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.510
A-All right.

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:10.840
<i>Oh yeah?</i>

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.270
I'll stick with Nagi-chan.

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:15.250
Yes. Thank you.

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:16.290
Hey!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.610
Let's go!

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:33.310
You're Nishizawa-san? Nice to meet you.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:35.540
Nice to meet you!

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:39.600
Oh, Sanzenin. What happened to Ayasaki?

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:43.650
I-It's not like Hayate's 
 always with me.

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.260
Huh? But he <i>is</i> always with you.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:49.010
He's your butler, right?

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.330
What's wrong?

00:13:56.920 --> 00:14:00.900
Oh, I forgot to tell you, Nagi-chan.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.940
This is Hayate-kun's, right?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:08.370
Whoa! You... Th-That's...

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:11.000
I happened to pick it up yesterday.

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:15.050
I was curious about what was 
going on, so I went looking...

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.170
...and I stumbled across it.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.590
I think the thieves must

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.260
have dropped it when 
they were running away.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.930
But...

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.800
If you have this...

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:35.030
Ah! The tire!

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:37.450
I knew it!

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:41.150
Brake! Brake!

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.770
It's no use! They're not working!

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:08.010
O-Ouch.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.430
Are you okay, Nagi-chan?

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:13.430
Yeah, I think so.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.310
I'm glad everyone's all right.

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:19.560
But why did the car suddenly break?

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.770
It's the clock.

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:23.630
It's called the black camellia,

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.990
and it brings its owner bad luck.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.900
Hey, it's gone!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:32.570
I just had it, but now it's gone!

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.350
Did you drop it?

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:36.580
Oh no! I lost it!

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.500
Don't worry about the clock.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.080
I must have dropped it at some point!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.070
I'll go look for it!

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:44.590
Don't worry about it! Hey, hamster!

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:49.040
I'll go back to the road and find someone.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:50.310
You stay here, Sanzenin.

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:58.600
I wish I'd never come to Las Vegas.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:02.600
Huh?

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:06.730
That stupid hamster. It's right here.

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:14.280
<i>My job as your butler is 
to protect you from danger.</i>

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.540
That's what you said, but...

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:24.040
I can get by on my own just fine.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:28.850
On my...

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:33.260
On... my own...

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.540
Gonna die...

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.470
I'm gonna die...

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:51.090
At this rate, someone's 
gonna discover the body

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:55.320
of an unidentified beauty 
in the Nevada Desert.

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:58.300
You too?

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:01.180
You're a thief, too? That's mine!

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:03.850
You dare steal that from 
me, you dumb cactus?

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.380
Give it back! Give back my hankie!

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:15.770
Oh, I see. A stupid cactus is 
making me get all serious.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.590
You're certainly going to regret—

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:24.750
Hot! I burned my hand!

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:30.020
It's in my eyes! 
My eyes! Ouch!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:47.120
Hayate!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.630
He's not gonna come.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:58.090
After all, he's not my butler anymore.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.640
<i>I'll protect you. I'm going to protect you.</i>

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:08.150
<i>Miss Nagi! Wake up, Miss Nagi!</i>

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:15.150
<i>Are you all right, Miss Nagi?</i>

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.680
<i>Miss Nagi.</i>

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:19.000
<i>You can count on me, Miss Nagi.</i>

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:19.980
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:22.870
<i>I'll protect you in both past and future.</i>

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:24.230
No.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.120
<i>Goodbye, Miss Nagi.</i>

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:35.920
No, no, no, no, no, no, 
no, no, no, no, no!

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:39.680
No!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:43.570
No!

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:47.340
I don't need anything else!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.310
I was wrong about everything!

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:53.480
I won't be selfish anymore!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.440
I'll get up early...

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.530
I'll go to school...

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:05.160
I'll... be a better person...

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:09.340
Hayate can't be gone...

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.110
I won't...

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.010
I won't accept it!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.010
Then let's go look for him.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:34.980
Then let's find him, so you 
can tell him how you feel!

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:41.490
Let's go look for Hayate-kun together!

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:52.180
Thanks...

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:01.260
Hey, wait up!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.260
Hey! Hey!

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:09.270
What is it? I'm busy.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.750
I'm busy, too.

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:14.150
I have to get back my 1.2 billion yen!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.340
Who cares?

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:19.200
You could help me out!

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.450
I'm in this mess because I borrowed

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.030
that clock, the black camellia.

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:24.990
<i>Annoying woman.</i>

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:27.580
Help me. Help!

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:31.110
Fine. How do you expect me to help?

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:34.180
Thanks! Now, come here.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.550
First...

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.350
I got one of them!

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:45.470
You're out of control, you know that?

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:49.430
More importantly, you're a student at Hakuo,

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.280
so you can speak English, yes?

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.250
Find out where my money is!

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.450
What?

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:55.800
I'll help...

00:20:56.840 --> 00:20:57.990
...with the torture part.

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:01.110
Honestly.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.490
Guess I'll have to.

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:04.730
Well...

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.150
If you don't want to be killed by the gorilla behind me,

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:12.150
<i>What, a gorilla? Did 
you just say gorilla?</i>

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:13.200
I highly suggest you tell us where you're keeping the money.

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:13.960
<i>Did you say gorilla?</i>

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:16.100
<i>You did, didn't you? Gorilla?</i>

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.380
No, I didn't.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.880
I'm busy.

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:26.610
Can you hurry up and decide if 
you'd rather talk or die?

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.800
Okay! Okay! Okay! I'll tell you!

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.450
Where's the money?

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:31.760
Our boss has it!

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:36.050
If our team got separated, we were to meet there to get our share.

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:37.430
Where exactly?

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:40.640
It's...

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:44.520
...at the Starside Hotel.

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:49.060
In annex top floor, room 1203.

00:21:56.770 --> 00:21:59.070
There you go, Gorilla-san.

00:21:59.070 --> 00:22:01.050
Who're you calling a gorilla?

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:03.120
So you <i>did</i> say gorilla!

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:04.250
No, I didn't.

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:06.340
You said gorilla! <i>You're</i> the gorilla!

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:09.430
Huh?
